==English==

===Etymology===
From the testing of [[gold]] with [[nitric acid]] (true gold is not affected)

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[acid]] [[test]]}}

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} a [[rigorous]] test or [[appraisal]] of the [[quality]] or [[worth]] of something

